WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:19.546
Anyone can do this. Nothing here is behind a PIN.

2
00:00:19.546 --> 00:00:27.000
Type any part of the attendee’s first or last name.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.058
The list narrows as you type. Three show at once.

4
00:00:32.058 --> 00:00:38.149
Tap the name to select it.

5
00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:43.202
Check In turns green. That means it is ready.

6
00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:49.390
Tap Check In. The arrival time is recorded for you.

7
00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:57.700
Done — the kiosk returns on its own, ready for the next person.
